:00\",\"CreatedBy\":\"MssBase.Service\",\"UpdatedOn\":\"2026-01-01T00:00:00\",\"UpdatedBy\":\"MssBase.Service\"},{\"Name\":\"Polysexual\",\"Description\":\"Is the attract to some, but not all, genders. They may be attracted to any combination of  possible genders, including binary \\u0026 non-binary\",\"Active\":false,\"CreatedOn\":\"2026-01-01T00:00:00\",\"CreatedBy\":\"MssBase.Service\",\"UpdatedOn\":\"2026-01-01T00:00:00\",\"UpdatedBy\":\"MssBase.Service\"},{\"Name\":\"Queer\",\"Description\":\"An LGBTQ\\u002B term the community is reclaiming. An identity label that is non-specific about a persons sexual orientation\",\"Active\":false,\"CreatedOn\":\"2026-01-01T00:00:00\",\"CreatedBy\":\"MssBase.Service\",\"UpdatedOn\":\"2026-01-01T00:00:00\",\"UpdatedBy\":\"MssBase.Service\"},{\"Name\":\"Questioning\",\"Description\":\"To be unsure of or re-examining ones previous assumption of sexual orientation\",\"Active\":false,\"CreatedOn\":\"2026-01-01T00:00:00\",\"CreatedBy\":\"MssBase.Service\",\"UpdatedOn\":\"2026-01-01T00:00:00\",\"UpdatedBy\":\"MssBase.Service\"},{\"Name\":\"Straight\",\"Description\":\"An heterosexual\",\"Active\":false,\"CreatedOn\":\"2026-01-01T00:00:00\",\"CreatedBy\":\"MssBase.Service\",\"UpdatedOn\":\"2026-01-01T00:00:00\",\"UpdatedBy\":\"MssBase.Service\"},{\"Name\":\"Skoliosexual\",\"Description\":\"The attraction to non-binary individuals\",\"Active\":false,\"CreatedOn\":\"2026-01-01T00:00:00\",\"CreatedBy\":\"MssBase.Service\",\"UpdatedOn\":\"2026-01-01T00:00:00\",\"UpdatedBy\":\"MssBase.Service\"},{\"Name\":\"Sapiosexual\",\"Description\":\"Sexually attracted to intelligence or the human mind\",\"Active\":false,\"CreatedOn\":\"2026-01-01T00:00:00\",\"CreatedBy\":\"MssBase.Service\",\"UpdatedOn\":\"2026-01-01T00:00:00\",\"UpdatedBy\":\"MssBase.Service\"}]", "PersonSexuality" });

