r many gender non-conforming or non-binary identities\",\"Active\":false,\"CreatedOn\":\"2026-01-01T00:00:00\",\"CreatedBy\":\"MssBase.Service\",\"UpdatedOn\":\"2026-01-01T00:00:00\",\"UpdatedBy\":\"MssBase.Service\"},{\"Name\":\"Intersex\",\"Description\":\"A person born with a reproductive or sexual anatomy that doesn\\u2019t seem to fit the typical definitions of female or male. For example, a person might be born appearing to be female on the outside, but having mostly male-typical anatomy on the inside\",\"Active\":false,\"CreatedOn\":\"2026-01-01T00:00:00\",\"CreatedBy\":\"MssBase.Service\",\"UpdatedOn\":\"2026-01-01T00:00:00\",\"UpdatedBy\":\"MssBase.Service\"},{\"Name\":\"Gender Variant\",\"Description\":\"Someone who either by nature or by choice does not conform to gender-based expectations of society\",\"Active\":false,\"CreatedOn\":\"2026-01-01T00:00:00\",\"CreatedBy\":\"MssBase.Service\",\"UpdatedOn\":\"2026-01-01T00:00:00\",\"UpdatedBy\":\"MssBase.Service\"},{\"Name\":\"Third Gender\",\"Description\":\"A term for a person who does not identify with either man or woman, but identifies with another gender. This gender category is used by societies that recognise three or more genders, both contemporary and historic, and is also a conceptual term meaning different things to different people who use it\",\"Active\":false,\"CreatedOn\":\"2026-01-01T00:00:00\",\"CreatedBy\":\"MssBase.Service\",\"UpdatedOn\":\"2026-01-01T00:00:00\",\"UpdatedBy\":\"MssBase.Service\"},{\"Name\":\"Transgender\",\"Description\":\"A person who lives as a member of a gender other than that expected based on sex assigned at birth\",\"Active\":false,\"CreatedOn\":\"2026-01-01T00:00:00\",\"CreatedBy\":\"MssBase.Service\",\"UpdatedOn\":\"2026-01-01T00:00:00\",\"UpdatedBy\":\"MssBase.Service\"},{\"Name\":\"Two-Spirit\",\"Description\":\"Is an umbrella term traditionally used by Native American people to recognise individuals who possess qualities of both genders\",\"Active\":false,\"CreatedOn\":\"2026-01-01T00:00:00\",\"CreatedBy\":\"MssBase.Service\",\"UpdatedOn\":\"2026-01-01T00:00:00\",\"UpdatedBy\":\"MssBase.Service\"},{\"Name\":\"Ze / Hir\",\"Description\":\"Alternate pronouns that are gender neutral.\\u202FPronounced /zee/ and /here/ they replace \\u201Che\\u201D and \\u201Cshe\\u201D and \\u201Chis\\u201D and \\u201Chers\\u201D respectively. Alternatively some people who are not comfortable/do not embrace he/she use the plural pronoun \\u201Cthey/their\\u201D as a gender neutral singular pronoun\",\"Active\":false,\"CreatedOn\":\"2026-01-01T00:00:00\",\"CreatedBy\":\"MssBase.Service\",\"UpdatedOn\":\"2026-01-01T00:00:00\",\"UpdatedBy\":\"MssBase.Service\"},{\"Name\":\"Non-Binary\",\"Description\":\"Someone who does not identify as a man or a woman, or solely as one of those two genders. It\\u2019s often used as an umbrella term for identities that fall outside the male/female gender binary. Being non-binary means different things to different people, so this definition is purposely broad\",\"Active\":false,\"CreatedOn\":\"2026-01-01T00:00:00\",\"CreatedBy\":\"MssBase.Service\",\"UpdatedOn\":\"2026-01-01T00:00:00\",\"UpdatedBy\":\"MssBase.Service\"},{\"Name\":\"Gender Neutral\",\"Description\":\"Someone who feels they are neither male or female may identify as gender neutral\",\"Active\":false,\"CreatedOn\":\"2026-01-01T00:00:00\",\"CreatedBy\":\"MssBase.Service\",\"UpdatedOn\":\"2026-01-01T00:00:00\",\"UpdatedBy\":\"MssBase.Service\"}]");

